text.en:
Regulation 8 of the principal Regulations is amended(a} in the regulation heading. by adding "and allowances'";

(b) by inserting"'( I)'" immediately before "A" in the first line;

(c) by adding the following new sub-regulation"(2) An allowance to be called a "'disability allowance·· shall be payable at the rate specified in the Schedule to these Regulations to a person with disability who satisfies the Pensions Officer that(a) he is below the age of 15 years; {b) he has been certified by a Government Medical Officer or a qualified medical practitioner approved by the Director-General of Medical Services as likely to be subject to disability for a considerable period; and

(c) either(i) he is a citizen of Brunei Darussalam; or

(ii) he was bam in Brunei Darussalam and he has no national status, immediately preceding the date on which he became eligible for such allowance.".
